    <briefdescription>
<para>Assign a GUID to functions as metadata. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>GUID calculation takes linkage into account, which may change especially through and after thinlto. By pre-computing and assigning as metadata, this mechanism is resilient to such changes (as well as name changes e.g. suffix &quot;.llvm.&quot; additions). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
